  <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_OGmZcOLtEeaSMtPPLb0UtQ" annotatedElement="_NIejkLGFEeak3rj-C-pKhA">
    <body>This stereotype indicates that the corresponding property or owned association end(s) may be implemented by the mechanism implied by the &quot;Identifiable&quot; stereotype
