  <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_R6ih0CjNEeezA761iS43gg" annotatedElement="_GNC_8CjNEeezA761iS43gg">
    <body>This stereotype indicates that there exists a mechanism for expressing instance identities that is separate from native, implementation-specific object references. Also the nature of that mechanism allows the instance identities to be non-transient</body>
